      "source": "https://getindiana.com/news/cambridge-city"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Cambridge City Historic District, including the Conklin‑Montgomery and Lackey‑Overbeck houses, is listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
